flowchart TD
  A[uvicorn starts main:app] --> B[lifespan context enters]
  B --> C[database.init_db]
  C --> C1[CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS x21 tables]
  C1 --> C2[Inline ALTER migrations in init_db lines 280-304]
  C2 --> C3[Normalize epss_score zeros]
  D[scheduler.start_scheduler] --> D1[Register 7 APScheduler jobs]
  D1 --> D2[scheduler.start]
  E[scheduler.maybe_run_on_startup] --> E1{CVE count less than 10?}
  E1 -->|yes| E2[asyncio.create_task run_full_ingest_sync]
  E1 -->|no| E3[strip_auto_generated_summaries + enrich_kev_summaries]
  E --> F[maybe_run_mitre_on_startup]
  F --> F1{mitre or atlas count less than 10?}
  F1 -->|yes| F2[create_task run_weekly_mitre_refresh]
  F1 -->|no| G[FastAPI ready — /api endpoints live]
  E2 --> G
  E3 --> G
  F2 --> G
  H[On shutdown] --> H1[scheduler.stop_scheduler]
